<title>CHILE: Chile's Enersis confirms water deal.</title>
<headline>Chile's Enersis confirms water deal.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chilean power utility Enersis SA said it has bought 55 percent of Santiago-based water company Empresa Agua Potable Lo Castillo.</p>
<p>Enersis will hold a news conference at 1600 local time/1900 GMT to give details of the deal, said the statement.</p>
<p>Lo Castillo, a small private water company, supplies water to Santiago's eastern suburbs.</p>
<p>-- Margaret Orgill, Santiago newsroom, 562-699-5595 x212</p>
</text>
